d into the dragon  level forms but was still able to kick  them at a speed they could not counter  after stunning them with a barrage of  fast kicks he managed to cross a great  distance and perform one of his ultimate  techniques slicing the two monsters in  half before they could even react his  actions were so fast that they seemed to  happen almost simultaneously flashy  flash's speed was also remarkable enough  to impress saitama with the latter  stating that he was kind of fast during  his fight against an evolved aguero the  two fighters were combating each other  at extreme speeds a geometric structure  of light was even created from their  blinding movements flashy flash is also  a very analytical fighter he  strategically waited for the right  moment to incapacitate gail wind and  hellfire flame simultaneously to prevent  either from escaping reasoning that the  other heroes would have trouble dealing  with their speed number 12 watchdog man  the next hero on our list is literally a  guy dressed up in a dog costume but make  no mistake because watchdog man is one  of the most powerful heroes in the  entire organization a testament to his  prowess is that he was left in charge of  queue city considered the most dangerous  city in terms of monsters numbers and  average disaster level he's also  described to eliminate monsters like no  other in his early days as a hero he  managed to rip off the head of an  enormous monster without incurring an  injury watchdog manages extremely fast  able to rip apart multiple monsters  within a few seconds despite being  surrounded by 30 monsters of monster  association watchdog man managed to  quickly defeat all of them and come out  of the battle without a scratch  surprising gero who was watching the  fight furthermore he could easily keep  up with and block all attacks from  garrow during their fight and retaliated  at a speed that the hero hunter was  unable to counter garrow himself even  commented that watchdog man's