r has claimed that  drive knight has never lost a battle  before this reputation is enough to  cause worry for the hero association  when the possibility of his defeat is  presented drive night's fighting style  consists of transforming multiple times  during a fight depending on the number  of monsters involved and on the strength  of each monster individually the speed  of each transformation does not seem to  be an inconvenience as it appears to  occur almost instantaneously like geno's  drive knight's body is powered by an  energy core when drive knight's energy  reserves are depleted he can fuse with  another cyborg or robot to access their  energy course thus allowing maximum  energy output number 8 zombie man zombie  man is the s-class rank 8 professional  hero and a product of the house of  evolution he is one of the few people  aware of saitama's power he's currently  aiming to become just as powerful as him  zombie man wears a special trench coat  that possesses unique properties  allowing him to carry many different  weapons with him at all times he is  shown using various handguns with  excellent proficiency and some close  range weapons described as a man that  even in death cannot die zombie man  possesses the best regeneration  capabilities in the series he can  regenerate any part of his body no  matter how severe the injury is for  example he was able to fully regenerate  from having a hole in his head and  broken arms in a few seconds even if he  is beheaded or his organs explode zombie  man will not die but will even  regenerate from such fatal injuries his  regeneration is so fast that one of  pureblood's bats could not escape his  flesh before zombie man fully healed  even after having parts of his body  incinerated by homeless emperor's energy  spheres zombie man was still capable of  fully regenerating albeit it may take  him quite a bit of time to recover there  was even a time he himself thought he  was dead however this regeneration does  not give zombie man complete immortality  as he will die if he is reduced to  mincemeat number 7 king now on to the  fan favorite and one of the funniest  heroes in the s-class king king is the  s-class rank 7 professional hero in  public king is known as the strongest  man on earth and hero's hero in truth  however he is just an average civilian  who unintentionally gained credit for  the heroic acts performed by saitama  king is also part of the saitama group  his status has resulted in being  targeted by assassins who are paid vast  sums of money by crime bosses  fortunately all assassins sent after him  are just as delusional as ordinary  people in perceiving king's false power  so they often think that they're  targeting the formidable foe and are  willing to give up when king peacefully  confronts them king's intimidating  presence while near the defeated  monsters gave the hero association the  false impression that he was strong king  in reality has never brawled before in  his life meaning he is the weakest  person in this class if not the entire  hero association his intimidating  characteristics also have no effect on  robotic opponents it should be noted  that his hero title does not fail to  describe his video game accomplishments  he is an expert at video games and has  won some video game tournaments in his  youth this talent later proves helpful  when king saves saitama who  irresponsibly signed a contract without  reading it fubuki forcibly wanted to  have saitama bang jenos and king join  the blizzard group should they win the  bet outlined in the contract the bet was  decided with video games and king  defeated 30 gamers by himself he can  also write scripts about video game  content since he often works on creating  an independent game during weekends it's  safe to say that king is a different  kind of hero but that's why he's one of  the fan favorites number 6 bullfoy dr  bofoy also known by his hero alias metal  knight is the s-class rank 6 hero of the  hero association he offers many services  for the hero association such as weapons  sponsorships and facility construction  being an s-class hero it can be assumed  that bullfoy is very powerful however he  got that position due to his brainpower  and the strength of his weapons instead  of his own physical strength according  to georgioro he is one of the four  heroes that could beat elder centipede  despite this he was unable to damage the  monster when he fought it with his drone  however it is noted that the full extent  of bolfoy's military might and weaponry  is unknown even to the hero association  this is why they fear his potential  betrayal as he would pose a huge threat  according to child emperor the power of  the weapons bolfoy possesses is beyond  that of any lone hero bofoy is said to  have a reputation for using powerful  weaponry to pulverize his opponents and  everything else in its vicinity he uses  various remotely controlled robots for  his missions and experiments equipped  for the occasion with this form of  combat bofoid doesn't put his own life  at stake as he controls his robots from  a safe distance number 5 child emperor  despite his young age child emperor is a  genius he has a very analytical mind and  is capable of observing situations and  formulating plans in a calm and  collected manner he managed to become  s-class rank 5 hero only at the age of  10 proving how powerful he is however  his high rank in the s-class is  primarily due to his brain power instead  of physical strength through tactics and  his gadgets he can defeat numerous  monsters on his own whether through  guerrilla warfare or prepared head-on  combat like his fellow s-class heroes  child emperor is strong enough to handle  a demon level monster on his own and  with relative ease however unlike most  of his allies who use direct force to  fight he fights with intellect and  strength preferring to create  opportunities preparations and  strategies to put the 