 a  professional hero a martial arts master  and the creator and teacher of water  stream rock smashing fist bang possesses  incredible physical strength despite his  old age far beyond that of an average  hero even by s-class standards he is the  third highest-ranked hero of the hero  association and is recognized as one of  its most powerful heroes in his youth he  was nicknamed wind of blood another of  bang's achievement is that he trained  garrow who was also incredibly strong  himself gyro stated that demon level  monsters like bug god and royal ripper  are nothing compared to his former  master he is known as an idol and  treasurer of martial arts almost like a  god in the martial arts world bang's  combination of immense physical power  and vast martial arts prowess makes him  one of the most powerful close range  fighters in the hero association his  amazing strength was demonstrated during  his fight against gums and fear her ugly  two dragon level monsters capable of  kicking through the former and thrashing  the latter without much effort  additionally despite gero constantly  improving and evolving bang has still  proved capable of fighting on equal  footing with him for a considerable  amount of time before finally being  defeated combining his strength with his  big brother bang knocked elder centipede  back and destroyed the enormous  monster's carapace armor which is  durable enough to withstand metal  knight's missiles and metal bat swings  without a scratch he was also able to  overpower garrow in hand-to-hand combat  before he evolved almost killing his  former student and proving how powerful  he is number two tatsumaki tatsumaki is  the character we've got to see quite a  few times so far in the series and she's  regarded as the strongest esper in the  entire world with her psychokinetic  abilities she was capable of  effortlessly stopping a very powerful  bombardment attack from boroso's giant  spaceship and sending them back at the  ship with